[{"id":183244529,"discussion_id":"25920debc28bb46c1e602e75d45513b2b67567c3","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n该 PR 修复了 Conv ONNX 插件中 `fixed_shift_value` 属性未能正确传递的问题。改动在 `ConvAttr` 结构体中新增了 `fixed_shift_value` 字段，并在 `SetAttrToOp`、`GetConvAttr` 和 `ParseOpToGraphConv` 三个关键函数中补齐了该属性从 ONNX 节点解析、存储到最终传递给图卷积算子的完整链路。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **新增 `FIXED_SHIFT_VALUE_DEFAULT` 常量**：定义默认值为 `0`，并在 `ConvAttr` 结构体中新增 `fixed_shift_value` 字段，默认初始化为该常量。\n- **`SetAttrToOp` 中新增属性解析**：在解析 ONNX `NodeProto` 属性时，增加对 `fixed_shift_value`（`INT` 类型）的识别，将其值设置到 `ge::Operator` 上。\n- **`GetConvAttr` 中新增属性回读**：从 `ge::Operator` 读取 `fixed_shift_value` 到 `ConvAttr`，若读取失败则回退为默认值 `FIXED_SHIFT_VALUE_DEFAULT`。\n- **`ParseOpToGraphConv` 中新增属性下发**：在构建图卷积算子时，将 `ConvAttr` 中的 `fixed_shift_value` 通过 `SetAttr` 写入目标 `conv` 算子，确保属性完整传递到下游。\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-04T22:31:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-04T22:35:48+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183244532,"discussion_id":"2525e42ba2fce3008efb33b50db538590c2b9dab","body":"#### 代码审查\n\n✅ 未发现问题\n\n","created_at":"2026-08-04T22:31:54+08:00","updated_at":"2026-08-04T22:56:23+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":183244547,"discussion_id":"90bac14f20309d4cf12bfdfb26039b67e8222200","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%